{"id":"278046f9a093bf22","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-honest-verifier-zero-knowledge.md","title":"Honest-Verifier Zero Knowledge","display":"df-honest-verifier-zero-knowledge — Honest-Verifier Zero Knowledge","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-honest-verifier-zero-knowledge","aliases":["28-df-honest-verifier-zero-knowledge","Honest-Verifier Zero Knowledge"],"display":"df-honest-verifier-zero-knowledge — Honest-Verifier Zero Knowledge","depends_on":["[[28-df-zero-knowledge]]","[[28-df-view]]","[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-negl]]"],"source_book_location":"§9.4 Definition 9.14 background; printed pp.187–188; PDF pp.213–214","source_printed_pages":"187–188","source_pdf_pages":"213–214","source_status":"supplementary-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-honest-verifier-zero-knowledge"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-honest-verifier-zero-knowledge</span><span>Honest-Verifier Zero Knowledge</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-honest-verifier-zero-knowledge — Honest-Verifier Zero Knowledge"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74e0b51f1b8e81e1\" href=\"?note=74e0b51f1b8e81e1\" title=\"28-df-zero-knowledge\">28-df-zero-knowledge</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e6a863785f69243\" href=\"?note=8e6a863785f69243\" title=\"28-df-view\">28-df-view</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§9.4 Definition 9.14 background; printed pp.187–188; PDF pp.213–214"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"187–188"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"213–214"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(s,H)\">\\(P=(s,H)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8e6a863785f69243\" href=\"?note=8e6a863785f69243\" title=\"28-df-view\">28-df-view</a> 的带固定随机长度的证明者表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,R,(P,V)\">\\(L,R,(P,V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、证书界及完备性、健全性采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"74e0b51f1b8e81e1\" href=\"?note=74e0b51f1b8e81e1\" title=\"28-df-zero-knowledge\">28-df-zero-knowledge</a> 的前提；这里固定协议规定的诚实验证者 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,u)\">\\(\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,u)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8e6a863785f69243\" href=\"?note=8e6a863785f69243\" title=\"28-df-view\">28-df-view</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{EPPT},\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(\\mathbf{EPPT},\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a>。模拟器只接收公共输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，各算法随机性独立。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HVZK}(P,V,L,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{HVZK}(P,V,L,R)\\)</span> 为诚实验证者计算零知识谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HVZK}(P,V,L,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists S\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}\\;\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\;\\forall x\\in L\\;\\forall u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[R(x,u)\\Rightarrow\\left|\\Pr[D(x,\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,u))=1]-\\Pr[D(x,S(x))=1]\\right|\\le\\mu(|x|)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HVZK}(P,V,L,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists S\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}\\;\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\;\\forall x\\in L\\;\\forall u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[R(x,u)\\Rightarrow\\left|\\Pr[D(x,\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,u))=1]-\\Pr[D(x,S(x))=1]\\right|\\le\\mu(|x|)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是从原书零知识定义固定诚实验证者所得的补充接口；本次未在原书发现独立编号的 HVZK 定义。它弱于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"74e0b51f1b8e81e1\" href=\"?note=74e0b51f1b8e81e1\" title=\"28-df-zero-knowledge\">28-df-zero-knowledge</a> 针对所有偏离协议验证者的条件；不从诚实验证者模拟器推断完整零知识。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-zero-knowledge","status":"resolved","id":"74e0b51f1b8e81e1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-zero-knowledge]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-view","status":"resolved","id":"8e6a863785f69243","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-view]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"